{
  "version": 1,
  "meta": {
    "id": "adaptive",
    "title": "Reading, with a way back round",
    "description": "Consent, a name, a section with a shared passage, a remediation loop and a branch on how sure the learner was.",
    "locale": "en",
    "askConfidence": true,
    "askReasoning": false,
    "navigation": "free",
    "allowSkip": true,
    "sections": [
      {
        "id": "passage",
        "label": "The passage",
        "markdown": "Ada Lovelace wrote what is often called the first computer program: a method for the Analytical Engine to compute Bernoulli numbers. The engine was never built.\n\nShe published it in 1843, as a note appended to her translation of somebody else's paper."
      }
    ],
    "pools": [
      { "id": "bank", "label": "Closing questions", "draw": 2, "shuffle": true }
    ],
    "timeLimit": 900
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "type": "start-simple",
      "position": { "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "data": {
        "title": "Reading, with a way back round",
        "markdown": "A short comprehension exercise.",
        "showOutline": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "consent",
      "type": "start-consent",
      "position": { "x": 0, "y": 140 },
      "data": {
        "title": "Before you start",
        "markdown": "This records your answers, how sure you said you were, and how long each question took. Your teacher can see all of it. Nothing about your device is recorded.",
        "agreeLabel": "",
        "requiredHint": "",
        "allowDecline": true,
        "declineLabel": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "declined",
      "type": "end-tries",
      "position": { "x": 360, "y": 140 },
      "data": {
        "title": "No problem",
        "markdown": "Nothing has been recorded. Tell your teacher you would rather do something else.",
        "showBreakdown": false,
        "showScore": false,
        "allowReview": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "who",
      "type": "start-identify",
      "position": { "x": 0, "y": 280 },
      "data": {
        "title": "Who you are",
        "markdown": "So your work can be handed back.",
        "fields": [
          {
            "id": "name",
            "label": "First name",
            "hint": "Or a nickname your teacher will recognise.",
            "required": true,
            "kind": "text",
            "options": []
          },
          {
            "id": "class",
            "label": "Class",
            "hint": "",
            "required": false,
            "kind": "select",
            "options": ["7a", "7b", "7c"]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "q-year",
      "type": "task-numeric",
      "position": { "x": 0, "y": 420 },
      "section": "passage",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "In which year did she publish it?",
        "expected": "1843",
        "tolerance": "exact",
        "allowExpression": false,
        "valueFeedback": [],
        "evaluation": { "mode": "auto", "enableRetry": false, "showFeedback": true, "weight": 1 }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "why-year",
      "type": "input-markdown",
      "position": { "x": 360, "y": 420 },
      "data": {
        "markdown": "Look again at the second paragraph. The year is written out in full."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "q-built",
      "type": "task-yes-no",
      "position": { "x": 0, "y": 560 },
      "section": "passage",
      "data": {
        "question": "Was the Analytical Engine ever built?",
        "correctAnswer": false,
        "evaluation": { "mode": "auto", "enableRetry": false, "showFeedback": true, "weight": 1 }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sure-but-wrong",
      "type": "input-markdown",
      "position": { "x": 360, "y": 560 },
      "data": {
        "markdown": "You were sure, and it was not right — which usually means the passage said something other than you expected. Read the last sentence of the first paragraph again before you carry on."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bank-1",
      "type": "task-choice",
      "position": { "x": 0, "y": 700 },
      "pool": "bank",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "What was the method for?",
        "variant": "single",
        "choices": [
          { "id": "c1", "markdown": "Computing Bernoulli numbers", "correct": true },
          { "id": "c2", "markdown": "Translating a paper", "correct": false },
          { "id": "c3", "markdown": "Building an engine", "correct": false }
        ],
        "shuffle": false,
        "partialCredit": false,
        "patternFeedback": [],
        "evaluation": { "mode": "auto", "enableRetry": false, "showFeedback": true, "weight": 1 }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bank-2",
      "type": "task-choice",
      "position": { "x": 0, "y": 840 },
      "pool": "bank",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "How was the method published?",
        "variant": "single",
        "choices": [
          { "id": "c1", "markdown": "As a note on a translation", "correct": true },
          { "id": "c2", "markdown": "As a book of her own", "correct": false },
          { "id": "c3", "markdown": "It was never published", "correct": false }
        ],
        "shuffle": false,
        "partialCredit": false,
        "patternFeedback": [],
        "evaluation": { "mode": "auto", "enableRetry": false, "showFeedback": true, "weight": 1 }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bank-3",
      "type": "task-choice",
      "position": { "x": 0, "y": 980 },
      "pool": "bank",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "Who is credited with the first computer program?",
        "variant": "single",
        "choices": [
          { "id": "c1", "markdown": "Ada Lovelace", "correct": true },
          { "id": "c2", "markdown": "Charles Babbage", "correct": false },
          { "id": "c3", "markdown": "Jacob Bernoulli", "correct": false }
        ],
        "shuffle": false,
        "partialCredit": false,
        "patternFeedback": [],
        "evaluation": { "mode": "auto", "enableRetry": false, "showFeedback": true, "weight": 1 }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "certificate",
      "type": "end-certificate",
      "position": { "x": 0, "y": 1120 },
      "data": {
        "title": "Well read",
        "markdown": "For getting most of the way through on your own.",
        "issuer": "Room 12",
        "showName": true,
        "showScore": true,
        "showDate": true,
        "printLabel": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "keep-a-copy",
      "type": "end-download",
      "position": { "x": 360, "y": 1120 },
      "data": {
        "title": "That is the end",
        "markdown": "Keep a copy of what you answered.",
        "buttonLabel": "",
        "filename": "reading",
        "includeAnswers": true
      }
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    { "id": "e-start", "source": "start", "target": "consent" },
    {
      "id": "e-declined",
      "source": "consent",
      "target": "declined",
      "label": "said no",
      "condition": {
        "type": "compare",
        "left": { "kind": "answer", "nodeId": "consent" },
        "op": "eq",
        "right": false
      }
    },
    { "id": "e-agreed", "source": "consent", "target": "who" },
    { "id": "e-who", "source": "who", "target": "q-year" },
    {
      "id": "e-year-wrong",
      "source": "q-year",
      "target": "why-year",
      "label": "wrong",
      "condition": {
        "type": "compare",
        "left": { "kind": "result", "nodeId": "q-year", "path": "state" },
        "op": "eq",
        "right": "wrong"
      }
    },
    { "id": "e-year-on", "source": "q-year", "target": "q-built" },
    {
      "id": "e-year-again",
      "source": "why-year",
      "target": "q-year",
      "label": "try again",
      "resetTarget": "result",
      "condition": {
        "type": "compare",
        "left": { "kind": "visits", "nodeId": "q-year" },
        "op": "lte",
        "right": 2
      }
    },
    { "id": "e-year-give-up", "source": "why-year", "target": "q-built" },
    {
      "id": "e-sure-but-wrong",
      "source": "q-built",
      "target": "sure-but-wrong",
      "label": "sure, and wrong",
      "condition": {
        "type": "and",
        "conditions": [
          {
            "type": "compare",
            "left": { "kind": "result", "nodeId": "q-built", "path": "state" },
            "op": "eq",
            "right": "wrong"
          },
          {
            "type": "compare",
            "left": { "kind": "confidence", "nodeId": "q-built" },
            "op": "gte",
            "right": 0.8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    { "id": "e-built-on", "source": "q-built", "target": "bank-1" },
    { "id": "e-reread", "source": "sure-but-wrong", "target": "bank-1" },
    { "id": "e-bank-1", "source": "bank-1", "target": "bank-2" },
    { "id": "e-bank-2", "source": "bank-2", "target": "bank-3" },
    {
      "id": "e-certificate",
      "source": "bank-3",
      "target": "certificate",
      "label": "did well in the passage",
      "condition": {
        "type": "compare",
        "left": {
          "kind": "scoreRatio",
          "scope": { "kind": "section", "id": "passage" }
        },
        "op": "gte",
        "right": 1
      }
    },
    { "id": "e-download", "source": "bank-3", "target": "keep-a-copy" }
  ]
